          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e17-money-and-professional-sport/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, why do you think sport matters so much to some people?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e17-money-and-professional-sport/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4700
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e17-money-and-professional-sport/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e17-a1",
            "c1-e17-a2",
            "c1-e17-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show people involved in sport at different levels. Choose two of the pictures and say what motivates the people, and how their experiences might differ.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e17-money-and-professional-sport/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12100
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these levels of sport would you find more rewarding?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e17-money-and-professional-sport/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e17-b1",
            "c1-e17-b2",
            "c1-e17-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show different people who influence sport. Choose two of the pictures and say how these people shape the way sport is played and watched, and what problems could arise.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e17-money-and-professional-sport/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12600
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, how much influence do you think money has on modern sport?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e17-money-and-professional-sport/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5200
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some issues in professional sport, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e17-money-and-professional-sport/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 9600
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e17-money-and-professional-sport",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these issues affect the reputation of sport?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e17-money-and-professional-sport/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6500
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e17-money-and-professional-sport",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which is the most damaging?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e17-money-and-professional-sport/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5200
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about professional sport and money.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e17-money-and-professional-sport/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5500
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Is it justifiable for top sportspeople to earn so much more than other professionals?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e17-money-and-professional-sport/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6000
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, to what extent should countries spend public money on hosting major sporting events?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e17-money-and-professional-sport/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6900
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, do you believe that competition in sport brings out the worst in people?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e17-money-and-professional-sport/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6000
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Should there be separate competitions for men and women in every sport?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e17-money-and-professional-sport/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4900
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, how can sport help to bring communities together?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e17-money-and-professional-sport/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, does watching sport on television encourage people to take part themselves?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e17-money-and-professional-sport/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6600
        }
      ]
    }
